&lt;br&gt;삭제 플래그 · SLA" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#232F3E;fontSize=12;fontColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=0;align=center;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="200" width="240" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="m2" value="M2 네트워크 개통&lt;br&gt;No 12 ~ 20&lt;br&gt;SNAT · 방화벽 · DNS&lt;br&gt;VIP/Ingress · TLS" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#7AA116;fontSize=12;fontColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=0;align=center;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="330" y="200" width="240" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="m3" value="M3 HMS-Warm 구축&lt;br&gt;No 21 ~ 24&lt;br&gt;Oracle 스키마 · 배포&lt;br&gt;HMS-Hot 정책 조정" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#01A88D;fontSize=12;fontColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=0;align=center;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="620" y="200" width="240" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="m4" value="M4 등록 자동화 PoC&lt;br&gt;+ 용인 Trino 검증&lt;br&gt;No 25 ~ 28" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#8C4FFF;fontSize=12;fontColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=0;align=center;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="910" y="90" width="240" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="m5" value="M5 Polaris federation PoC&lt;br&gt;No 29 ~ 32&lt;br&gt;lake_hot / lake_warm" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#1F6FEB;fontSize=12;fontColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=0;align=center;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="910" y="320" width="240" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="m7" value="M7 운영 이관&lt;br&gt;No 33&lt;br&gt;대상 확대 · 사용자 가이드" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#232F3E;fontSize=12;fontColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=0;align=center;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1220" y="200" width="240" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="m6" value="M6 Archive Rollover 구현&lt;br&gt;No 11&lt;br&gt;Job 설계 · 정리 ILM 규칙" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#ED7100;fontSize=12;fontColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=0;align=center;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="330" y="440" width="240" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="g40" value="G1 복제 방향 · 버킷명 동일 여부" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF1F0;strokeColor=#DD344C;fontSize=12;fontColor=#DD344C;fontStyle=1;align=center;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="90" width="240" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="g330" value="G2 경로 A/B · 진입점(VIP/Ingress)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF1F0;strokeColor=#DD344C;fontSize=12;fontColor=#DD344C;fontStyle=1;align=center;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="330" y="90" width="240" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="g620" value="G3 Oracle 배치 · HMS 버전" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF1F0;strokeColor=#DD344C;fontSize=12;fontColor=#DD344C;fontStyle=1;align=center;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="620" y="90" width="240" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg" value="병렬 가능: M2(네트워크) 와 M6(Archive) 는 M1 이후 동시 진행&lt;br&gt;M4 · M5 는 M3 완료 후 병렬 PoC → 둘 다 통과해야 M7&lt;br&gt;각 단계 완료 기준: INDEX §3 해당 No 전부 ☑ + 03-future 검증 항목(H-50~54, P-01~08) 통과" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FAFBFC;strokeColor=#5E6C84;fontSize=12;fontColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=0;align=left;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="620" y="460" width="830" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c11" value="해야 할 일 — 마일스톤 의존 관계 (M1 → M7)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=22;fontColor=#000000;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="16" width="1420" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c12" value="박스 안 No = INDEX §3 작업 번호 · 빨간 게이트 = 다음 단계 착수 전 확정해야 할 결정" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5E6C84;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="48" width="1420" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
